WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:03,030
There is so much less fun in life

2
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:05,830
Fanjia is preparing to conduct long-term research on these rare samples

3
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:07,830
All conclusions must be tested and approved

4
00:00:07,830 --> 00:00:09,030
I have my own career

5
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:10,330
Nor will I entrust your wealth to you

6
00:00:10,330 --> 00:00:12,780
Then why did you suddenly propose dating?

7
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:13,980
I appreciate your ability

8
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,380
I am also willing to get to know you seriously

9
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,780
Family cooperation is cooperation

10
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,080
Feelings cannot be exchanged

11
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,880
So how to deal with the cooperation between the two parties?

12
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:21,880
Separately sign scientific research samples and procurement contracts

13
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:24,280
Price testing and intellectual property rights are clearly written down

14
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,580
Whether or not you have a relationship does not affect any business conditions

15
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:27,980
If we have a formal relationship in the future

16
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,780
Be loyal to each other as equals

17
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,780
Also respect each other’s work and property boundaries

18
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:34,610
If you can't do this, don't start.

19
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:38,110
He was quite right this time.

20
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:42,010
Sample contract: Emotions depend on the wishes of both parties and cannot be mixed.

21
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:45,010
As long as both parties are sincere and have clear boundaries

22
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:47,810
No matter what the boss chooses, it should not affect other fates
